<title>SOUTH AFRICA: LesiureNet cautions shareholders on talks.</title>
<headline>LesiureNet cautions shareholders on talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>LesiureNet Ltd said on Tuesday that it was in talks which could have an impact on its share price and urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>It also referred shareholders to announcement of April 17 that it was considering the sale of its food interests and said these discussions were continuing.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
